><div data-slot="lane"><span data-tier="plus" style="width:100%"></span><span data-slot="remainder"></span></div></div></td><td data-slot="number"><span>∞</span><span>∞</span></td><td data-slot="number"><span>∞</span><span>∞</span></td></tr><tr data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a322a36"><th scope="row"><bdi>Step 5 Preview Free</bdi><!--$--><span data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a322a370" data-slot="labels"><!--$--><small data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a322a3710">New</small><!--/--><!--$--><small data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a322a3720">Limited Time</small><!--/--><!--$--><!--/--></span><!--/--></th><td data-slot="bars" aria-hidden="true"><!--$--><span data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a322a380" data-slot="gridline" style="inset-inline-start:4%"></span><span data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a322a381" data-slot="gridline" style="inset-inline-start:11.180922955388251%"></span><span data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a322a382" data-slot="gridline" style="inset-inline-start:36.99485754485973%"></span><!--/--><div data-slot="track"><div data-slot="lane"><span data-tier="go" style="width:100%"></span><span data-slot="remainder"></span></div><div data-slot="lane"><span data-tier="plus" style="width:100%"></span><span data-slot="remainder"></span></div></div></td><td data-slot="number"><span>∞</span><span>∞</span></td><td data-slot="number"><span>∞</span><span>∞</span></td></tr></tbody><tfoot aria-hidden="true"><tr><td></td><td data-slot="axis"><span data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a3230" style="inset-inline-start:4%">100</span><span data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a3231" style="inset-inline-start:11.180922955388251%">1K</span><span data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a3232" style="inset-inline-start:36.99485754485973%">10K</span></td><td colspan="2"></td></tr></tfoot></table></div><figcaption><button type="button" data-slot="expand" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="0000000100000000000100000a320"><!--$-->View all 31 models<!--/--><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 6 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></button><a href="/docs/go/#usage-limits">Usage limits</a></figcaption></figure></section><section data-component="problem"><div data-slot="section-title"><h3>What problem is Go solving?</h3><p><!--$-->We're focused on bringing the OpenCode experience to as many people as possible. OpenCode Go is a low cost $10/month subscription. It provides generous limits and reliable access to the most capable open source models.<!--/--> <!--$-->Go Plus costs $40/month with higher limits.<!--/--></p></div><p> </p><ul><li><span>[*]</span> <!--$-->Low cost subscription pricing<!--/--></li><li><span>[*]</span> <!--$-->Generous limits and reliable access<!--/--></li><li><span>[*]</span> <!--$-->Built for as many programmers as possible<!--/--></li><li><span>[*]</span> <!--$-->A curated model lineup tested for agentic coding<!--/--></li></ul></section><section data-component="how"><div data-slot="section-title"><h3>How Go works</h3><p><!--$-->Go costs $10/month. You can use it with OpenCode or any agent.<!--/--> <!--$-->Go Plus costs $40/month with higher limits.<!--/--></p></div><ul><li><span>[1]</span><div><strong>Create an account</strong> - <!--$-->follow the<!--/--> <a href="/docs/go/#how-it-works" title="setup instructions">setup instructions</a></div></li><li><span>[2]</span><div><strong>Subscribe to Go</strong> - <a href="/docs/go/#pricing">$10/month</a> <!--$-->with generous limits<!--/--> · <!--$-->Go Plus costs $40/month with higher limits.<!--/--></div></li><li><span>[3]</span><div><strong>Start coding</strong> - <!--$-->with reliable access to open-source models<!--/--></div></li></ul></section><section data-component="faq"><div data-slot="section-title"><h3>FAQ</h3></div><ul><li><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a3301000" data-closed="" id="collapsible-0000000100000000000100000a3300" data-slot="faq-item" ><button data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a33010010000" type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-closed="" data-slot="faq-question" ><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a33010010001" data-slot="faq-icon-plus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12.5 11.5H19V12.5H12.5V19H11.5V12.5H5V11.5H11.5V5H12.5V11.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a33010010002" data-slot="faq-icon-minus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 11.5H19V12.5H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a33010010003" data-slot="faq-question-text">What is OpenCode Go?</div></button></div></li><li><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a3401000" data-closed="" id="collapsible-0000000100000000000100000a3400" data-slot="faq-item" ><button data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a34010010000" type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-closed="" data-slot="faq-question" ><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a34010010001" data-slot="faq-icon-plus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12.5 11.5H19V12.5H12.5V19H11.5V12.5H5V11.5H11.5V5H12.5V11.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a34010010002" data-slot="faq-icon-minus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 11.5H19V12.5H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a34010010003" data-slot="faq-question-text">What models does Go include?</div></button></div></li><li><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a3501000" data-closed="" id="collapsible-0000000100000000000100000a3500" data-slot="faq-item" ><button data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a35010010000" type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-closed="" data-slot="faq-question" ><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a35010010001" data-slot="faq-icon-plus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12.5 11.5H19V12.5H12.5V19H11.5V12.5H5V11.5H11.5V5H12.5V11.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a35010010002" data-slot="faq-icon-minus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 11.5H19V12.5H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a35010010003" data-slot="faq-question-text">What is the difference between free models and Go?</div></button></div></li><li><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a3601000" data-closed="" id="collapsible-0000000100000000000100000a3600" data-slot="faq-item" ><button data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a36010010000" type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-closed="" data-slot="faq-question" ><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a36010010001" data-slot="faq-icon-plus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12.5 11.5H19V12.5H12.5V19H11.5V12.5H5V11.5H11.5V5H12.5V11.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a36010010002" data-slot="faq-icon-minus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 11.5H19V12.5H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a36010010003" data-slot="faq-question-text">Is Go the same as Zen?</div></button></div></li><li><div data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a3701000" data-closed="" id="collapsible-0000000100000000000100000a3700" data-slot="faq-item" ><button data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a37010010000" type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-closed="" data-slot="faq-question" ><svg data-hk="0000000100000000000100000a37010010001" data-slot="faq-icon-plus" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg